This repository holds the plugin-facing contract only: the sidecar's service
definition and the message framing a plugin receives. The domain messages the
runtime exchanges past the sidecar live in meridian-core, under the GNU Affero
General Public License v3.0.

On 2026-09-21 this repository's history was rewritten so that no commit
contains those domain messages, and the repository was recreated to carry the
rewritten history. Commit identifiers from before that date do not exist here.
